    "explanation": "Due to his lack of crowd control, Ragnaros will not be able to pressure Heroes whose Basic Abilities are weak to interrupts (such as Sonya).\n\nRagnaros is also particularly weak to kite because he does not have access to any tool that can help him playing around enemy displacement effects (such as Garrosh and Raynor) and Slows (such as Jaina)."
  },
