    "explanation": "Ragnaros excels on Maps where he can double soak with ease (such as Infernal Shrines), especially if he can get value from Molten Core to win the Objective or defend after losing it.\n\nThe worst Maps for Ragnaros are the ones where it is important to control a Capture Point, especially if it is impossible for him to double soak as an alternative strategy (such as Braxis Holdout), or where the Objective can be too far from Forts that Molten Core cannot be used during it (such as Towers of Doom)."
  },
